    "title": "Method Template",
    "description": "A real trigger binding, not an isolated invoke/trigger port pair: an event-raising Method wired, by a real event:<key> -> trigger edge, to a second Method that fires because of it. The template's own detail view explains how that edge gets authored (MethodTriggersEditor's Add a trigger dropdown) and why trigger always shows a lightning-bolt glyph.",
